I don't know about named arrows, but I would like to see a few more
named items/special items.

Mjollnir should return when thrown.  (I know, they're working on it.)
There should be a pistol in the game, to go along with the bullwhip.
There should be a spear and magic helmet of lightning bolts.

What about a new kind of shop--a pet shop.  It would contain items
such as the following: tripe rations, leashes, flea collars (which
would provide various forms of protection), rabies vaccination kits,
and special food items--Purina titanothere chow, Cycle n dog
food(increased HP), magic sticks(throw it, and your pet chases after
it), and so on.  Call it Bertha's Kitty Boutique.  :-)

One more thing about pets.  When a rabid rat bites a pet, the pet
should have a chance to turn rabid:

"The rabid rat bites Old Yeller."
"You kill the rabid rat."
{1000 turns later}
"Old Yeller starts to foam at the mouth.  You feel very sad."
"You swing at Old Yeller.  You hit Old Yeller.  You start to cry."

This should entail no luck penalties.
